==Managers==

===Managers===
Celtic started the season under the newly appointed [[John Barnes (footballer)|John Barnes]]<ref>{{cite web | url=https://news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/sport/football/scottish_premier/365579.stm | title=Dalglish back at Parkhead |website=BBC Sport | date=10 June 1999 | access-date=17 November 2011}}</ref> who, on 10 February, was sacked by the club.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/uk_news/scotland/637415.stm | title=Barnes forced out |website=BBC Sport | date=15 February 2000 | access-date=17 November 2011}}</ref> Celtic's Director of Football [[Kenny Dalglish]] took over as caretaker manager.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.theguardian.com/football/2011/jan/09/kenny-dalglish-liverpool-roy-hodgson | title=Kenny Dalglish to rescue as Liverpool part company with Roy Hodgson | work=The Guardian| date=8 January 2011 | access-date=17 November 2011}}</ref>

